Package: Uno
Type: Package
Title: R Interface to the Uno Nonlinear Optimization Solver
Version: 2.7.2-1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Balasubramanian", "Narasimhan", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "naras@stanford.edu"),
    person("Charlie", "Vanaret", role = c("aut", "cph"),
           comment = "Author of Uno"),
    person("Alexis", "Montoison", role = c("aut", "cph")))
Description: R bindings to 'Uno' (Unifying Nonlinear Optimization), a C++ solver
    for nonlinearly constrained optimization, via Uno's C API. The 'HiGHS' QP/LP
    subproblem solver is built from source (for the SQP presets); the 'MUMPS'
    linear solver used by the interior-point preset is reached at runtime through
    the 'rmumps' package. Intended as a nonlinear (DNLP) backend for 'CVXR'; this
    is the R analog of the 'unopy' Python package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/cvanaret/Uno
BugReports: https://github.com/cvanaret/Uno/issues
SystemRequirements: CMake (>= 3.16), C++17, GNU make
Depends: rmumps (>= 5.2.1-41)
LinkingTo: cpp11, rmumps
Suggests: cpp11, tinytest
NeedsCompilation: yes
